('apt_baima_walkup_2b_0402','rent','Old Baima Lake Community Two-Bedroom on Fourth Floor, No Elevator','Hangzhou','Binjiang District','Huxiyuan',820000,69.0,2,'Bus Route 137 Huxiyuan Stop 260m','{"available_from":"2026-08-01","property_fee_minor":9000,"renovated_at":"2018-05","elevator":false,"floor":4,"balcony_guardrail_cm":105,"window_locks":"partial","written_terms":"landlord_review"}','Cross-ventilated from north to south, with a relatively narrow stairway turn; the kitchen gas alarm was replaced last year.','["Stairway turn","Second bedroom windowsill","Kitchen alarm"]','agt_shen_baima',NULL,'active','2026-07-09T08:46:00+08:00'),
('apt_qianjiang_3b_1606','rent','Qian River Century City Three-Bedroom with Two Bathrooms and Storage Room','Hangzhou','Xiaoshan District','Chaowen Mansion',1380000,104.0,3,'Metro Line 2 Yingfeng Road Station 710m','{"available_from":"2026-08-06","property_fee_minor":56000,"renovated_at":"2022-11","elevator":true,"floor":16,"balcony_guardrail_cm":116,"window_locks":"installed","written_terms":"draft_available"}','The three-bedroom has ample space, but the cross-river commute is long, and both the monthly rent and property fees exceed the family''s original budget.','["Storage room","Two bathrooms","South gate of residential complex"]','agt_fan_qianjiang',NULL,'active','2026-07-13T17:08:00+08:00'),
('apt_xixing_studio_0911','rent','Xixing Studio Near Metro with Bay Window','Hangzhou','Binjiang District','Xiling Apartments',650000,36.0,1,'Metro Line 5 Xixing Station 190m','{"available_from":"2026-07-25","property_fee_minor":15000,"renovated_at":"2020-03","elevator":true,"floor":9,"balcony_guardrail_cm":0,"window_locks":"none","written_terms":"standard"}','The studio has plenty of storage cabinets but no separate children''s room, and the bay window is sixty centimeters above the floor.','["Studio panoramic view","Bay window","Shared hallway"]','agt_luo_binjiang',NULL,'delisted','2026-07-06T19:35:00+08:00');
